=========================================
GO TESTING CHEAT SHEET
=========================================

--- Standard Tests ---
1. The Quick Check (Logic only, no cache)
go test -count=1 ./...

2. The Detailed Check (Logic only, loud/verbose, no cache)
go test -count=1 -v ./...

3. The Heavy Traffic Check (Logic + Concurrency, no cache)
go test -count=1 -race ./...

4. Run a Specific Test (Replace TestName with the actual function name)
go test -count=1 -run TestName ./...

--- Benchmarks ---
5. Run All Benchmarks + Check Memory Usage (Highly recommended for performance tuning)
go test -count=1 -bench=. -benchmem ./...

--- Code Coverage ---
6. Check Test Coverage Percentage (Quick summary)
go test -count=1 -cover ./...

7. Generate a Test Coverage Profile (Saves the detailed data to a file)
go test -count=1 -coverprofile=coverage.out ./...

8. View the Coverage in your Web Browser (Run #7 first!)
go tool cover -html=coverage.out


